Package: trialr
Version: 0.1.6
Title: Stand-in for 'trialr' in the browser
Description: Lets 'escalation' load under webR, where 'rstan' cannot be
    installed. Provides the three functions 'escalation' imports from
    'trialr'; they stop with an error, as Stan models cannot run in the
    browser. The app does not use them. Only bundled with the Shinylive
    build of the app; never installed elsewhere.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
